    "title": "Inside Vanessa Trump's dynamic with 'intense' boyfriend Tiger Woods as athlete is charged with another DUI",
    "text": "Vanessa Trump has been revealed to have an “intense” relationship with Tiger Woods after he was arrested for DUI again. “Vanessa and Tiger are in love,” an insider told People following the pro golfer’s car crash and arrest last Friday. “She is very supportive of his golf endeavors because despite his age and injuries, golf dominates Tiger’s life,” the insider added. “They are good together as they both have golf in their lives. That propels the romance in a certain sense.” Vanessa Trump has an “intense” relationship with Tiger Woods (seen above with the former model in March 2025). X/@TigerWoods A source told People that the pro golfer (seen above with Trump in March 17) can be “difficult to be around” sometimes because of his past injuries. TGL Golf via Getty Images The source told the outlet that Woods, 50, can be “difficult to be around” sometimes because of the pain he experiences following his seventh back surgery and the rupture of his Achilles tendon. “She has her hands full sometimes, but Vanessa also has a life of her own and children to care for, so she isn’t around it all the time,” the insider claimed. “She is happy with him and any issues they have are not about her. It’s dealing with his frustrations about playing great golf and his pain that at some times is really confining,” they added. Another source told People that the athlete — who began secretly dating Trump, 48, last year — may need to do some soul-searching. “They are an intense couple,” the insider shared. “It’s serious but Tiger has yet to look in the mirror and say, ‘You’re 50 years old and need to act like it.'” (Pictured: Woods and Trump in 2025.) X/@TigerWoods Last Friday, the billionaire athlete was involved in a rollover car crash (seen above) in Jupiter Island, Fla. via REUTERS Want more celebrity and pop culture news? Start your day with Page Six Daily. Thanks for signing up! “They are an intense couple,” the insider shared. “It’s serious but Tiger has yet to look in the mirror and say, ‘You’re 50 years old and need to act like it.'” Page Six has reached out to Woods for comment but did not immediately hear back. Last Friday, the billionaire athlete was involved in a rollover car crash in Jupiter Island, Fla., and he crawled out of his vehicle after the incident. Sheriff John Budensiek said during a press conference that Woods — who has a history of car crashes — showed “signs of impairment and refused a urinalysis test, leading to charges of DUI with property damage and refusal to submit to a lawful test.” Sheriff John Budensiek said Woods (seen above after the crash) showed “signs of impairment and refused a urinalysis test.” AP Woods (seen above in his mugshot) was arrested and charged with DUI. via REUTERS Woods and Vanessa (both seen above on March 24) began dating last year. GREG LOVETT/PALM BEACH POST / USA TODAY NETWORK via Imagn Images Though the dad of two’s breathalyzer test returned negative, he refused to give a urine sample and was subsequently arrested and charged with DUI. Hours after his arrest, Woods’ bloodshot-eyed mugshot was released to the public, as well as photos of him leaving the jail. Page Six exclusively revealed that Woods’ girlfriend and her daughters were not involved in the crash. A day after the accident, Vanessa returned to Instagram to reshare two posts from her eldest daughter, Kai Trump. The mom of five reportedly issued a fierce ultimatum to Woods following his latest DUI. Vanessa shares kids Kai, 18, Donald John III, 17, Tristan, 14, Spencer, 13, and Chloe, 11, with ex-husband Donald Trump Jr. (Pictured: Vanessa, Kai, Spencer and Chloe.) Woods shares two kids with ex-wife Elin Nordegren (seen above with the kids and the golfer in 2009). Getty Images An insider told the Daily Mail that Vanessa is a “concerned girlfriend expressing boundaries and saying that he’s got to get his s–t together, like right now.” The former model shares kids Kai, 18, Donald John III, 17, Tristan, 14, Spencer, 13, and Chloe, 11, with ex-husband Donald Trump Jr. Woods is a dad to son Charlie Axel, 17, and daughter Sam Alexis, 18, whom he shares with his ex-wife, Elin Nordegren.",
